# Pyokotan no Dai Meiro (NES) — v3 conservative table
# Verified literal strings support ASCII bytes 0x20–0x7E.
# Visual inspection of CHR bank-0 tiles suggests 0x91–0x9F are ア–ソ in gojuon order.
# The 0x91–0x9F mapping is provisional: confirm game-code -> tile-index mapping using runtime trace before injection.
# Tile indices 0x90 and 0xB0 both visually resemble ー (long-vowel dash); runtime use is unverified.
# IMPORTANT: unlike v1, this file does NOT assume JIS X 0201 half-width kana for 0xA1–0xDF.
# Any <XX> entry is an undecoded placeholder, not a real character. 0x00–0x1F/0x7F are omitted; treat as controls/unknown.

